
### 1. Get all books
GET http://localhost:3000/books

### 2. Search books by title
GET http://localhost:3000/books?search_q=Harry

### 3. Sort books by price (highest to lowest)
GET http://localhost:3000/books?order_by=price&order=DESC

### 4. Pagination
GET http://localhost:3000/books?limit=3&offset=0

### 5. Filter books by price
GET http://localhost:3000/books?min_price=200&max_price=300

### 6. Get book by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/books/1

### 7. Get book with invalid ID
GET http://localhost:3000/books/999

### 8. Add a new book
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "The Secret",
    "author": "Rhonda Byrne",
    "price": 250,
    "pages": 200
}

### 9. POST with missing title (400 error)
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "author": "Test Author",
    "price": 250,
    "pages": 200
}

### 10. POST with invalid price (400 error)
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Test Book",
    "author": "Test Author",
    "price": "abc",
    "pages": 200
}

### 11. Update an existing book
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/10
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "The Secret - Updated",
    "author": "Rhonda Byrne",
    "price": 300,
    "pages": 250
}

### 12. Update book with invalid ID
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Test Book",
    "author": "Test Author",
    "price": 200,
    "pages": 150
}

### 13. Delete an existing book
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/10

### 14. Delete book with invalid ID
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/999

### 15. Invalid sorting order
GET http://localhost:3000/books?order=INVALID

### 16. Invalid limit
GET http://localhost:3000/books?limit=-5

### 17. Invalid price range
GET http://localhost:3000/books?min_price=500&max_price=200

### 18. Invalid sorting column
GET http://localhost:3000/books?order_by=invalid

### 19. POST with missing author
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Sample Book",
    "price": 200,
    "pages": 150
}

